Volume: ~20–30 priority vendors (Private Label &amp; Direct Import)
Owner: Compliance Officer / Internal Audit
Participants: Procurement, Sustainability Lead, Third-Party Auditors, Vendors
Source: workflow W353 — Ethical Sourcing &amp; Social Compliance Audit</bpmn:documentation>
