        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-306 (ensure controlled execution — Specialized Audit Domains (PA-21.3).) | - operational: Internal Audit / Corporate Secretary review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Internal Audit / Corporate Secretary</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
